# ── Rust build artifacts (regenerated by cargo; ~8 GB) ─────────────
native/target/

# ── NLLB model weights (multi-GB, exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit) ────
# Re-download with:  python dl_model.py  &&  python dl_1.3b.py
nllb-model/
nllb-1.3b-model/
**/.cache/

# ── Build outputs / binaries (produced by build, not source) ───────
native/*.dll
*.pdb
native/overseer-icons/
native/README.md

# ── Runtime logs the DLL writes next to the repo during dev runs ─────
native/overseer-logs/

# ── Local, user-supplied custom-intro media — not source ───────────
intro_full.bin
intro_song.ogg

# ── Editor / OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
